## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate foundational knowledge of the Old and New Testaments.
- Understand essential Christian doctrines and biblical principles.
- Develop spiritual maturity and Christlike character.
- Understand the person, work, and gifts of the Holy Spirit.
- Apply biblical teachings to Christian life and discipleship.
- Develop basic skills in evangelism and Christian ministry.
